<template name="tus_settings_gui_Monomachine">
<head>
	<style>
		.settings-storage-actions {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 6dp;
			width: 100%;
		}
		.settings-storage-actions .button {
			display: block;
			box-sizing: border-box;
			width: 100%;
		}
		.settings-storage-actions .button:disabled {
			opacity: 0.45;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<h1>Firmware</h1>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label id="lblFirmwareImage">Running: stock OS</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div class="settings-storage-actions">
		<button id="btChooseFirmware" class="button">Load Firmware Image...</button>
		<button id="btStockFirmware" class="button">Use Stock OS</button>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>An 8 MiB flash image with the stock boot loader: the stock OS or a community OS such as Machinedrum X.13 or the Monomachine EMS firmware (make one from an OS upgrade .syx with tools/elektronOsToFlash.py). Switching restarts the machine from a fresh factory state. The choice becomes the default for new instances and is saved with the project.</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<h1>Panel Rendering</h1>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div id="btPixelPerfectPanel" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Crisp LCD and panel lines (experimental)</label>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Use whole-pixel LCD enlargement and align thin panel lines to pixels. Changes immediately; the LCD may appear smaller with more space around it.</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div id="btLcdRotaryInteraction" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Drag and scroll rotary controls shown on the LCD</label>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Works on synthesis parameter screens. Menus, empty cells, and other LCD controls remain inert.</label>

	<settingsspacer1/>
	<h1>Tooltips</h1>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<div id="btTooltips" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Show tooltips for knobs, LCD fields and the machine name</label>
	</div>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Pop-up delay: how long the pointer rests on something before its tooltip appears</label>
	<table class="settings-table">
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btTooltipDelay0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Instant</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btTooltipDelay250" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>0.25 s</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btTooltipDelay500" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>0.5 s</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btTooltipDelay1000" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>1 s</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btTooltipDelay2000" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>2 s</label>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>

	<settingsspacer1/>
	<h1>Controller</h1>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>The touchpad and the gyro (hold the PS button and tilt) each turn two knobs. Choose a knob for each direction. The focused column is the column of the data entry knob that has the controller's focus. Standalone only.</label>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Face buttons: which one acts on the focus and which exits</label>
	<table class="settings-table">
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadFaceLayout0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Auto (the controller's labels)</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadFaceLayout1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>By position: bottom acts</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadFaceLayout2" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Nintendo labels: A (right) acts</label>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Touchpad, sliding left / right</label>
	<table class="settings-table">
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Focused column, top</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Focused column, bottom</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget20" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>LEVEL</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget99" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Off</label>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget10" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>A</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget11" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>B</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget12" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>C</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget13" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>D</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget14" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>E</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget15" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>F</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget16" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>G</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXTarget17" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>H</label>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
	<div id="btPadTouchXFunction" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Hold FUNCTION while turning (Machinedrum: changes that parameter on every track)</label>
	</div>
	<div id="btPadTouchXAbsolute" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Absolute position (touchpad corner or tilt angle = knob value)</label>
	</div>
	<div id="btPadTouchXInvert" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Invert direction</label>
	</div>
	<label>Speed (for tilt in absolute mode: how far to tilt)</label>
	<table class="settings-table">
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXSpeed25" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>25%</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXSpeed50" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>50%</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXSpeed100" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>100%</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXSpeed200" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>200%</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchXSpeed400" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>400%</label>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Touchpad, sliding up / down</label>
	<table class="settings-table">
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Focused column, top</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Focused column, bottom</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget20" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>LEVEL</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget99" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Off</label>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget10" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>A</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget11" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>B</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget12" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>C</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget13" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>D</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget14" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>E</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget15" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>F</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget16" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>G</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYTarget17" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>H</label>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
	<div id="btPadTouchYFunction" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Hold FUNCTION while turning (Machinedrum: changes that parameter on every track)</label>
	</div>
	<div id="btPadTouchYAbsolute" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Absolute position (touchpad corner or tilt angle = knob value)</label>
	</div>
	<div id="btPadTouchYInvert" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
		<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
		<label>Invert direction</label>
	</div>
	<label>Speed (for tilt in absolute mode: how far to tilt)</label>
	<table class="settings-table">
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYSpeed25" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>25%</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYSpeed50" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>50%</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYSpeed100" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>100%</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYSpeed200" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>200%</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTouchYSpeed400" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>400%</label>
				</div>
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
	<settingsspacer1/>
	<label>Tilt, rolling left / right</label>
	<table class="settings-table">
		<tr class="settings-tr">
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTiltRollTarget0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Focused column, top</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTiltRollTarget1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
					<label>Focused column, bottom</label>
				</div>
			</td>
			<td class="settings-td">
				<div id="btPadTiltRollTarget20" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel">
					<button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/>
